  "The chart under the picture is a histogram: how many pixels sit at each brightness. “Automatic” uses Otsu's method (Otsu, 1979) to find the line that splits the pixels most cleanly into two groups. Document scanners still work this way.": "图像下面的这张图是直方图：每个亮度上有多少像素。“自动”使用 Otsu 的方法（Otsu, 1979），找出能把像素最干净地分成两组的那条线。扫描文档的机器至今仍是这样做的。",
