  "Brighter means a stronger edge. Raise the gain to see faint ones. The machine still has no idea what any line is, but shape is starting to appear. The first layers of a trained CNN often end up learning filters much like this on their own.": "更亮，表示边缘更强。把增益调高，就能看见淡的边缘。机器仍然不知道任何一条线是什么，但形状开始出现了。训练好的 CNN，最前面的几层常常会自己学出很像这样的滤波器。",
  "Use your camera and move a hand slowly. How clear are your fingers against a light or a dark background?": "使用你的摄像头，把手慢慢移动。在浅色背景前和在深色背景前，你的手指有多清楚？",
  "Gain": "增益",
