  "Six rooms. The machine found": "六个房间。机器找到了",
  "Zero screens — in rooms made of screens — because COCO\\'s “tv” is a living-room television; a forty-feed video wall is something it never learned. It misses most of the chairs, too, and most of the people it does see are visitors, not operators. The machine misses things as well. That is exactly why this classroom exists.": "零块屏幕——房间里明明满是屏幕——因为 COCO 的“tv”是客厅里的电视机；四十路的视频墙，是它从未学过的东西。椅子也大多被漏掉。它看到的人，大多是来访者，不是操作员。机器同样会漏看。这正是这间教室存在的原因。",
  "It cannot tell who is looking at which screen, and a seamless video wall often counts as one “tv”. The machine misses things too.": "它分不清谁在看哪一块屏幕，连成一片的视频墙常常被算成一个“tv”。机器也会漏掉东西。",
