  "Choose the name matching the picture. Collect both groups, then press Learn. Watch whether it gets new moving frames right.": "选择与图像相符的名称。两组都收集，然后按下“学习”。看它能否把新的运动帧判对。",
  "It puts similar pictures together. You decide what the groups mean afterwards. It might group by lighting instead of traffic.": "它把相似的图像放在一起。这些组是什么意思，由你事后决定。它也可能按光线分组，而不是按车流。",
  "This is trial and reward. You rate an action, rather than name a picture. Future choices use the rewards it received.": "这是试一次、给一次奖励。你给动作打分，而不是给图像起名。以后的选择会用到它得到的奖励。",
  "Supervised learning uses your labelled examples and nearest neighbours. The vote is not a test score. Try frames you did not collect; add examples when it is wrong.": "监督学习使用你标注过的例子和最近邻。这次投票不是考试分数。试一试你没有收集过的帧；判错了就再加例子。",
  "This is real two-group k-means on the collected frames. It does not know which group means busy. Groups may have different sizes.": "这是对收集到的帧做真正的两组 k-means。它不知道哪一组表示繁忙。两组的数量可以不同。",
  "This is a one-step contextual bandit: alert or stay quiet. It learns from your rewards. It does not change traffic or train a multi-step driving policy.": "这是一步 contextual bandit：报警，或保持安静。它从你给出的奖励里学习。它不会改变交通，也不会训练多步的驾驶策略。",
